# Call the Spirit Dragons: "Dragons you control have indestructible." Every permanent its controller controls that is a Dragon
# (CR 613.1f), not only creatures: Firdoch Core is a Kindred Artifact with changeling, so a Dragon, and not a creature. Bot2's
# Shatter destroys target artifact; the Core is indestructible and stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Call the Spirit Dragons
Firdoch Core
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mountain
Shatter
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
